## What shipped

### v2.4.0 (terminal-safety + honesty + the PyPI storefront)
- All three HIGHs: the nested curses.wrapper teardown (one-shot stdscr published into _SCREEN), the j/k filter hijack (guard on filter_on, arrows navigate, small menus unchanged), and the open_screen curses-less NameError.
- configure_theme atomic value validation + per-pair color init; the small filter/terminal batch (Esc recompute, \r strip, short-terminal clamp, text_mode reset, ProgressBox close force-draw); CJK cell-width helpers at every width site with the shared _hborder box-frame helper.
- Honesty: block/block_light wired into the bars (gate), _Cancelled deprecated with a warning (gate: removal at 3.0), MAGENTA/DIM removed (gate), reset_terminal engagement gate + docstring, digit letter-key rejection, "DANGER: " label, CP 1-6 reservation documented, letter_keys documented fallback-only (gate), styled-fallback recast, API.md created, CLAUDE.md floors corrected to >=2.3.0.
- PyPI-facing: README storefront (Install, usage, 3.14 floor, accurate consumer line), pyproject keywords/classifiers/[project.urls] (PEP 639; decision 62 closed: the wheel carries License-Expression: GPL-3.0-or-later), publish.yml SHA-pinned (checkout v4, setup-python v5, gh-action-pypi-publish v1.14.2) + permissions + concurrency + twine check --strict + wheel smoke-install + create-release job; GitHub description/topics/homepage set; comment/prose pass (em-dashes, banners, module docstrings, .gitignore expansion, .venv_ci deleted).

### v2.5.0 (session awareness + the feature queue)
- progress() session-aware factory; session-aware color() + public tui_active(); scrolling viewport + item i/N counter for tall menus; pager match highlighting + "line i/N . M matches" indicator; flash() one-line notice (prompt_path routes through it); FALLBACK/INVALID constants + public pause(); safe_addstr published; full type annotations + py.typed.

